WEBVTT

00:00:03.126 --> 00:00:03.855
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.743 --> 00:00:08.520
<v><b>Man:</b></v> There was a strange noise outside our door.

00:00:10.961 --> 00:00:11.642
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:15.483
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> There weren’t any more strange noises.

00:00:17.924 --> 00:00:18.677
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.661 --> 00:00:22.643
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> We knew that people said there were ghosts.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:25.908
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.731 --> 00:00:29.980
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> There wasn’t anybody in that room last night.